Decision Report — AI Decision Strategist
Day 45/60 — #60DaysOfClaudeAI
An interactive decision report built with Claude, breaking down a real tough call: accept a full-time job offer now, or finish the degree full-time first. Includes an option-by-option breakdown, a cognitive bias check, a 7-dimension animated scoring matrix, a premortem on both options, a 7-day test plan, and a decisive verdict — plus 3 shareable cards for social.
Features
Option-by-option case breakdown (strengths, hidden upside, weaknesses)
Assumption Buster — surfaces biases like loss aversion and sunk cost
Animated 7-dimension scoring matrix with a clear winner
Premortem on both options with early warning signs
7-day test plan to validate the decision before committing
Decisive verdict with a hard-truth takeaway
3 shareable mini-cards for LinkedIn screenshots
Zero dependencies — single HTML file, fully responsive, no API calls needed
Tech
Vanilla HTML/CSS/JS. No frameworks, no CDN dependencies.
Usage
Open decision-report.html in any browser. Scroll through the full report — matrix bars animate on load.
